nd="00:19.110">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.110" end="00:23.550"><span begin="00:19.110" end="00:19.470">But </span><span begin="00:19.470" end="00:19.650">I'm </span><span begin="00:19.650" end="00:20.100">hoping </span><span begin="00:20.100" end="00:20.610">she </span><span begin="00:20.610" end="00:21.120">might </span><span begin="00:21.120" end="00:21.720">feel </span><span begin="00:21.720" end="00:22.080">the </span><span begin="00:22.080" end="00:23.550">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.060" end="00:26.430"><span begin="00:24.060" end="00:24.660">So </span><span begin="00:24.660" end="00:25.050">here </span><span begin="00:25.050" end="00:25.170">I </span><span begin="00:25.170" end="00:25.560">go </span><span begin="00:25.560" end="00:26.340">again</span><span begin="00:26.340" end="00:26.430">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.430" end="00:28.680"><span begin="00:26.430" end="00:26.670">She </span><span begin="00:26.670" end="00:27.000">got </span><span begin="00:27.000" end="00:27.180">my </span><span begin="00:27.180" end="00:27.570">heart </span><span begin="00:27.570" end="00:28.440">again</span><span begin="00:28.440" end="00:28.680">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.680" end="00:31.140"><span begin="00:28.680" end="00:29.760">Tonight </span><span begin="00:29.760" end="00:30.210">we'll </span><span begin="00:30.210" end="00:31.140">dance</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.200" end="00:36.690"><span begin="00:31.200" end="00:31.740">I'll </span><span begin="00:31.740" end="00:32.220">be </span><span begin="00:32.220" end="00:33.090">yours </span><span begin="00:33.090" end="00:33.210">and </span><span begin="00:33.210" end="00:33.690">you'll </span><span begin="00:33.690" end="00:34.200">be </span><span begin="00:34.200" end="00:36.690">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.720" end="00:39.270"><span begin="00:36.720" end="00:37.260">We </span><span begin="00:37.260" end="00:37.800">won't </span><span begin="00:37.800" end="00:38.310">look </span><span begin="00:38.310" end="00:39.240">back</span><span begin="00:39.240" end="00:39.270">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.270" end="00:44.730"><span begin="00:39.270" end="00:39.810">Take </span><span begin="00:39.810" end="00:40.290">my </span><span begin="00:40.290" end="00:41.160">hand </span><span begin="00:41.160" end="00:41.340">and </span><span begin="00:41.340" end="00:41.820">we </span><span begin="00:41.820" end="00:42.240">will </span><span begin="00:42.240" end="00:44.730">shine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.730" end="00:46.470"><span begin="00:44.730" end="00:45.078">Oh</span><span begin="00:45.078" end="00:45.426">, </span><span begin="00:45.426" end="00:45.774">oh</span><span begin="00:45.774" end="00:46.122">, </span><span begin="00:46.122" end="00:46.470">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.500" end="00:48.480"><span begin="00:46.500" end="00:46.890">She </span><span begin="00:46.890" end="00:47.220">needs </span><span begin="00:47.220" end="00:47.340">a </span><span begin="00:47.340" end="00:47.910">wild </span><span begin="00:47.910" end="00:48.480">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.510" end="00:50.580"><span begin="00:48.510" end="00:48.840">She </span><span begin="00:48.840" end="00:49.230">needs </span><span begin="00:49.230" end="00:49.350">a </span><span begin="00:49.350" end="00:49.950">wild </span><span begin="00:49.950" end="00:50.580">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.610" end="00:53.700"><span begin="00:50.610" end="00:50.910">I </span><span begin="00:50.910" end="00:51.270">got </span><span begin="00:51.270" end="00:51.360">a </span><span begin="00:51.360" end="00:51.930">wild </span><span begin="00:51.930" end="00:53.700">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.780" end="01:03.450"><span begin="01:00.780" end="01:01.470">Stay </span><span begin="01:01.470" end="01:01.950">here</span><span begin="01:01.950" end="01:01.950">, </span><span begin="01:01.950" end="01:02.490">my </span><span begin="01:02.490" end="01:03.270">dear</span><span begin="01:03.270" end="01:03.450">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.450" end="01:07.620"><span begin="01:03.450" end="01:03.810">Feels </span><span begin="01:03.810" end="01:04.110">like </span><span begin="01:04.110" end="01:04.320">I've </span><span begin="01:04.320" end="01:04.470">been </span><span begin="01:04.470" end="01:05.010">standing </span><span begin="01:05.010" end="01:05.490">right </span><span begin="01:05.490" end="01:06.000">here </span><span begin="01:06.000" end="01:06.480">for </span><span begin="01:06.480" end="01:07.620">years</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.880" end="01:11.460"><span begin="01:08.880" end="01:09.450">My </span><span begin="01:09.450" end="01:10.050">mind's </span><span begin="01:10.050" end="01:10.680">beat </span><span begin="01:10.680" end="01:11.460">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.490" end="01:15.960"><span begin="01:11.490" end="01:11.790">Tell </span><span begin="01:11.790" end="01:12.090">me </span><span begin="01:12.090" end="01:12.390">that </span><span begin="01:12.390" end="01:12.510">you </span><span begin="01:12.510" end="01:12.990">feel </span><span begin="01:12.990" end="01:13.290">this</span><span begin="01:13.290" end="01:13.410">, </span><span begin="01:13.410" end="01:13.680">and </span><span begin="01:13.680" end="01:13.950">I </span><span begin="01:13.950" end="01:14.340">won't </span><span begin="01:14.340" end="01:14.730">give </span><span begin="01:14.730" end="01:15.960">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.800" end="01:19.050"><span begin="01:16.800" end="01:17.160">I </span><span begin="01:17.160" end="01:17.370">won't </span><span begin="01:17.370" end="01:17.730">give </span><span begin="01:17.730" end="01:19.050">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.080" end="01:21.570"><span begin="01:19.080" end="01:20.190">Tonight </span><span begin="01:20.190" end="01:20.610">we'll </span><span begin="01:20.610" end="01:21.570">dance</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.600" end="01:27.090"><span begin="01:21.600" end="01:22.140">I'll </span><span begin="01:22.140" end="01:22.620">be </span><span begin="01:22.620" end="01:23.520">yours </span><span begin="01:23.520" end="01:23.670">and </span><span begin="01:23.670" end="01:24.120">you'll </span><span begin="01:24.120" end="01:24.630">be </span><span begin="01:24.630" end="01:27.090">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.120" end="01:29.670"><span begin="01:27.120" end="01:27.660">We </span><span begin="01:27.660" end="01:28.200">won't </span><span begin="01:28.200" end="01:28.710">look </span><span begin="01:28.710" end="01:29.640">back</span><span begin="01:29.640" end="01:29.670">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.670" end="01:33.300"><span begin="01:29.670" end="01:30.240">Take </span><span begin="01:30.240" end="01:30.690">my </span><span begin="01:30.690" end="01:31.560">hand </span><span begin="01:31.560" end="01:31.770">and </span><span begin="01:31.770" end="01:32.220">we </span><span begin="01:32.220" end="01:32.640">will </span><span begin="01:32.640" end="01:33.300">shine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.300" end="01:36.870"><span begin="01:33.300" end="01:33.420">Oh</span><span begin="01:33.420" end="01:35.130">, </span><span begin="01:35.130" end="01:35.160">oh</span><span begin="01:35.160" end="01:35.190">, </span><span begin="01:35.190" end="01:36.870">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.900" end="01:38.910"><span begin="01:36.900" end="01:37.290">She </span><span begin="01:37.290" end="01:37.620">needs </span><span begin="01:37.620" end="01:37.740">a </span><span begin="01:37.740" end="01:38.310">wild </span><span begin="01:38.310" end="01:38.910">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.940" end="01:40.980"><span begin="01:38.940" end="01:39.300">She </span><span begin="01:39.300" end="01:39.630">nee